  "description": "Find the minimum number of steps to make two strings equal by deleting characters.",
  "target": 2,
  "pseudocode": "1. m = word1.length, n = word2.length\n2. dp = matrix(m+1, n+1, 0)\n3. for i = 1 to m:\n4.   for j = 1 to n:\n5.     if word1[i-1] == word2[j-1]:\n6.       dp[i][j] = dp[i-1][j-1] + 1\n7.     else:\n8.       dp[i][j] = max(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1])\n9. result = (m + n) - (2 * dp[m][n])",
